            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/3653c64d9900d32b7b58cdc2fb20a4b6.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br>Element é um jogo intergalático de estratégia em tempo real para pessoas que não têm tempo para jogar jogos intergaláticos de estratégia em tempo real.<br><br><i>Seu lar não fornece mais nenhum meio para sobreviver.<br>Uma luta por recursos para escapar do nosso sistema já começou.<br>O futuro está além...</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/198fe2aaf60f53044a636efab7e6375d.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br>Element é um jogo intergalático de estratégia em tempo real com visual impressionante, com grande foco em fácil jogabilidade.<br><br>Element é para amantes de jogos belos e originais. É para pessoas que gostam do espaço e de jogos de estratégia, mas não têm horas de tempo livre para investir. É também para jogadores que gostam de disparar mísseis e explodir coisas :)<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/5c574c755231e772a1a346535bb4f1d8.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/72d01e5a227a7cd38eb281a243188323.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br>Você está escapando de um sistema solar em decomposição. Você deve visitar cada planeta, minerar elemento suficiente e derrotar o inimigo para que possa progredir para planetas mais longínquos. Gere energia, minere elemento, construa unidades de ataque e defesa e destrua o inimigo mantendo um equilíbrio entre terra, ar e água.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/63be0c62d575b406f665adcc576520f5.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Game Input.</strong><br>Element supports keyboard, mouse, keyboard and mouse, touch on supported platforms, and a game controller. Any method of input can be used at any time. Our preferred input method is a game controller with rumble support.<br><br>Game controller support on Windows and macOS uses native input libraries and supports XInput devices where possible. Supported platforms also allow rumble and lighting for selected controllers (eg. PS4 or XBox One Controller), and the ability to connect game controllers at any time. Legacy input requires game controllers to be connected before the game launches.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/4dd085e160e02e8b5d62eeff5cc4b10f.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Game Speed.</strong><br>The game speed can be adjusted using the -/+ keys to super-slomo and accelerate time while playing. Use '0' to reset to normal speed. Pause in-game using the menu button on the right side of the screen, pressing 'P' or 'Escape' on the keyboard, or using the menu/option button on your game controller. The game view can be fully controlled while the game is paused.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/243d7252063201e2e8558efaff3bfa74.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Screenshots.</strong><br>You can save a screenshot to your standard pictures folder using '.' on the keyboard. Use 'Shift+.' to take a high-resolution screenshot.<br><br>In-game you can toggle free-camera mode using 'Shift+Alt+C' to fly around slowly, and use 'Shift+Alt+M' to toggle menu visibility. The free-camera mode can be used while playing or paused and is intended mainly for beauty shots rather than gameplay.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/06164812009d34b5c05d12491e07831c.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Notes.</strong><br>The game requires a vertical resolution of at least 640px and our recommended minimum resolution is 720p. The game will happily render up to 4K/2160p. Linux support for Element is considered experimental but we are continuing to support it.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/3653c64d9900d32b7b58cdc2fb20a4b6.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br>Element é um jogo intergalático de estratégia em tempo real para pessoas que não têm tempo para jogar jogos intergaláticos de estratégia em tempo real.<br><br><i>Seu lar não fornece mais nenhum meio para sobreviver.<br>Uma luta por recursos para escapar do nosso sistema já começou.<br>O futuro está além...</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/198fe2aaf60f53044a636efab7e6375d.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br>Element é um jogo intergalático de estratégia em tempo real com visual impressionante, com grande foco em fácil jogabilidade.<br><br>Element é para amantes de jogos belos e originais. É para pessoas que gostam do espaço e de jogos de estratégia, mas não têm horas de tempo livre para investir. É também para jogadores que gostam de disparar mísseis e explodir coisas :)<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/5c574c755231e772a1a346535bb4f1d8.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/72d01e5a227a7cd38eb281a243188323.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br>Você está escapando de um sistema solar em decomposição. Você deve visitar cada planeta, minerar elemento suficiente e derrotar o inimigo para que possa progredir para planetas mais longínquos. Gere energia, minere elemento, construa unidades de ataque e defesa e destrua o inimigo mantendo um equilíbrio entre terra, ar e água.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/63be0c62d575b406f665adcc576520f5.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Game Input.</strong><br>Element supports keyboard, mouse, keyboard and mouse, touch on supported platforms, and a game controller. Any method of input can be used at any time. Our preferred input method is a game controller with rumble support.<br><br>Game controller support on Windows and macOS uses native input libraries and supports XInput devices where possible. Supported platforms also allow rumble and lighting for selected controllers (eg. PS4 or XBox One Controller), and the ability to connect game controllers at any time. Legacy input requires game controllers to be connected before the game launches.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/4dd085e160e02e8b5d62eeff5cc4b10f.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Game Speed.</strong><br>The game speed can be adjusted using the -/+ keys to super-slomo and accelerate time while playing. Use '0' to reset to normal speed. Pause in-game using the menu button on the right side of the screen, pressing 'P' or 'Escape' on the keyboard, or using the menu/option button on your game controller. The game view can be fully controlled while the game is paused.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/243d7252063201e2e8558efaff3bfa74.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Screenshots.</strong><br>You can save a screenshot to your standard pictures folder using '.' on the keyboard. Use 'Shift+.' to take a high-resolution screenshot.<br><br>In-game you can toggle free-camera mode using 'Shift+Alt+C' to fly around slowly, and use 'Shift+Alt+M' to toggle menu visibility. The free-camera mode can be used while playing or paused and is intended mainly for beauty shots rather than gameplay.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/422300/extras/06164812009d34b5c05d12491e07831c.avif?t=1589098487\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><strong>Notes.</strong><br>The game requires a vertical resolution of at least 640px and our recommended minimum resolution is 720p. The game will happily render up to 4K/2160p. Linux support for Element is considered experimental but we are continuing to support it.",
